    "displayName": "Kitchen Sink",
    "version": "1.0",
    "docs": {
      "description": "A deliberately pathological spec covering the constructs `corpus/pixwel` never exercises (SPEC.md §7): anyOf, discriminated unions, allOf composition, cursor pagination, nested resource groups, both nullability dialects, non-JSON content, binary and streaming responses, and non-trivial path parameters.\nHand-authored rather than harvested, so it is a *conformance fixture*, not a substitute for a real gnarly public spec. Its job is to make each documented gap fail loudly."
    },
